ures":"This script was developed as a fun project to improve your gameplay experience. It comes with a complete set of visual, utility, automation, and progression features 🚀\n\n👁️ Visuals & ESP\nESP Players lets you see all players through walls.\nESP Vents helps you instantly locate escape and movement routes.\nESP Items makes sure you never miss lootable items.\nESP Windows allows you to easily find entry and exit points.\nESP Generators helps you track objectives with no effort.\nESP Coins maximizes your gold farming.\nESP Chests specifically tracks wooden chests needed to craft weapons and take down the Killer.\n\n⚔️ Automation & Combat\nAura Task automatically completes nearby tasks.\nAura Sabotage (Killer) automatically triggers sabotages for maximum chaos.\nAnti-Trap prevents you from getting caught in Killer traps.\n\n🛠️ Utility & Performance\nFull Bright removes darkness and shadows for full visibility.\nAnti-AFK prevents getting kicked for inactivity.\nNoClip allows you to walk through walls and obstacles.\nFPS Boost optimizes game settings for smoother performance.\n\n💰 Progression Glitch (High Risk / High Reward)\nInfinite Money & XP Bug is a powerful exploit that generates massive amounts of money and XP.\n\nHow it works: you must let the Killer down you or stand near a downed player. The script will trigger an infinite “save” loop.\n\n⚠️ Important: this feature causes heavy lag. Do NOT use it like a normal option. Use it carefully.\n\n🔒 Free vs Freemium Version (IMPORTANT NOTICE)\nThe FREE version no longer has access to the Infinite Money / XP bug and will NOT receive any further updates.\n\nOnly the FREEMIUM version, already available inside the Bug section of the script itself, will continue to receive updates and will include the Infinite Money / XP feature.\n\nThe free version is now limited and considered final / discontinued in terms of updates.\n\n🔧 Executors & Compatibility\nThe script supports practically all executors, especially XENO.\nOn XENO, everything works perfectly except the Infinite Money bug ❌\nXENO causes extreme lag on this feature, which breaks the code and makes it unusable.\n\n✅ Best experience\nAny paid executor works normally with all features.\n\n🆓 Free executors\nVelocity works perfectly with all features.\nXENO works perfectly except for the Infinite Money bug.\n\n📱 Mobile Support\nThe script has full mobile support and all features work.\nThe only issue on mobile is that the panel is very small, since the UI was made thinking only about PC 💻\n\nTo activate any function on mobile, just keep clicking on the option. After a few tries it activates, it’s not impossible 👍\n\n📲 Infinite Money Bug on Mobile\nWhen activating the Infinite Money bug on mobile, go to Roblox settings and enable “Tap to Move”.\nThis makes your character move by double-tapping the screen.\n\n🚫 Playing like this is horrible, so only enable this setting when doing the Infinite Money bug. Do NOT keep using it like a normal feature.\n\n📌 Best mobile executor\nDelta is the best option and works perfectly.\n\n📢 Attention\nIf you have any questions or problems, join my Discord and let me know so I can check and help 💬","tags":["oneofus","oneofusscript","killer"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/nCuDz8nYSN","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"66a4a958048506d9237e78ce","username":"V3NENO","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/93cb4cd0655d09147c291751fe2b204920fe5d2aba515e878f66dcf0e0f72edb.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66a4a958048506d9237e78ce-1768093126531.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"66a4a958048506d9237e78ce","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/93cb4cd0655d09147c291751fe2b204920fe5d2aba515e878f66dcf0e0f72edb.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66a4a958048506d9237e78ce-1768093126531.jpg"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":fa